# .gitignore = a list of files and folders git must NEVER save or upload.
# Anything listed here stays on this computer only. It never goes to GitHub
# and never goes onto the live website.

# My personal clothing photos (private: some are underwear).
# The public site starts with an empty closet; everyone adds their own pieces.
images/clothes/

# Anything I want to keep private in this folder (spare photos, notes, etc.)
private/

# Closet backup files made with the BACKUP button (they contain photos)
*.closet
*backup*.zip

# Settings for the Claude Code helper (not part of the website)
.claude/

# Junk files Windows and Mac create by themselves
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
